WEBVTT

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:05.040
We've been renting the Cradlewise
for a little over a month.

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:09.740
We originally got it, um, because
our baby was not sleeping very well,

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.380
and so we wanted to rent it to make
sure he was gonna like it before we

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.000
decided if we were gonna purchase one.

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:19.900
So it's been really nice to have just a
month-to-month without a commitment to

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.520
be able to test it out and see
if he's sleeping any better.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:26.560
And so far, we've been getting
a little bit longer stretches,

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:30.140
which has been really nice. Really
happy to get a little bit more sleep.
